NOTE ON HUMAN SUBJECTS DATA

This dataset derives from interviews with human participants conducted under an
institutional review board protocol. It has been de-identified prior to
release; see the "Data availability and de-identification" section of README.md
for what was removed. Users must not attempt to re-identify participants or
their employers, and must not combine this dataset with other sources for that
purpose.
